  m_text: "Art Team\nUI, PR - Annette Hansen Ulveseth\nAnimation, Charactes Design
    - Elise Bergstad Aronsen\nEnvironment, Character Design - Maya Houtz\n\n\n\n\n\n\nProgramming
    Team\r\nEnemies, Bosses - Marcus Wiborg\r\nSystem Engineer - Erlend Eiken Oppedal\r\nLevel
    Designer, Audio Designer- H\xE5kon Raddum Hvitsand\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\n\r\nExtensive
    Playtesters - The Game Design class at Sunnhordaland Folkeh\xF8gskole 24/25\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\n\nSpecial
    Thanks\r\nSpecial Thanks - Sunnhordaland Folkeh\xF8gskole \r\nMentor - Markus
    Lange\nPlaying the game - You"
